{
  "schemaVersion": "1.0",
  "id": "e-be-made-of",
  "lexicon": "zkv",
  "number": 55,
  "kind": "phrase",
  "headword": "be made of",
  "star": true,
  "senses": [
    {
      "zh": "由……制成"
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "The earth "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "is"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " mainly "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "made of"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " iron and silicon and things like that."
        }
      ],
      "zh": "地球主要由铁、硅之类的物质构成。"
    }
  ],
  "tip": [
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "be made of 是常考词组，所以学生一定要掌握其用法，及比较与 be made from 和 be made into 的用法区别："
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "strong",
          "v": "be made of"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " 的意思是“由……制成”，表示制成成品后，仍可看出原材料是什么，保留原材料的质地形状，制作过程仅发生了物理变化。主语是成品，of 后面是原材料。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "strong",
          "v": "be made from"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " 的意思是“用……制成”，表示制成的东西完全失去了原材料的外形或特征，或原材料在制作过程中发生了化学变化，在成品中已无法辨认。主语是成品，from 后面是原材料。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "strong",
          "v": "be made into"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " 的意思是“被制成”，是被动形式。所以主语是原材料，into 后面是成品。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如：The desks and chairs "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "are made of"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " wood. 这些课桌椅都是由木头制成的。"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "This kind of wine "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "is made from"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " rice. 这种酒是由米酿成的。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "注意：be made into, be made from 和 make…into… 在许多时候可互换使用。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如：Wood can "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "be made into"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " paper. 木材可以制成纸。"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "= Paper can "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "be made from"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " wood. 纸可以用木材制造。"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "= We can "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "make"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " wood "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "into"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " paper. 我们可以把木材制成纸。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
